WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.835
Inclusion is built day by day.

2
00:00:05.585 --> 00:00:10.032
In a lab or team, leaders can rotate speaking roles in meetings, ask

3
00:00:10.032 --> 00:00:16.571
quieter members for their input, recognise contributions publicly, and make decisions transparently.

4
00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:23.304
Institutions support DEI beyond individual projects through leadership commitment, resources and

5
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:29.225
staff training, partnerships with communities, and systematic data collection and benchmarking.

6
00:00:29.975 --> 00:00:31.703
To know what works, monitor it.

7
00:00:32.053 --> 00:00:37.119
Useful metrics include the demographics of applicants and hires, participation and

8
00:00:37.119 --> 00:00:42.123
advancement by group, and who receives authorship and presentation opportunities.

9
00:00:42.873 --> 00:00:45.881
Be careful with interventions that only count uptake.

10
00:00:46.231 --> 00:00:52.160
Studies show that generic mentoring or family-friendly policies, measured only by how many

11
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.431
people use them, often fail to show real improvements in diversity or inclusion.

12
00:00:58.181 --> 00:01:03.770
Monitor regularly, act on the results, and review DEI outcomes when the project ends.

